</section>
<section class="ltx_subsection" id="S4.SS3">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">
<span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.3 </span>Comparison with State-of-the-art Generation Models</h3>
<div class="ltx_para" id="S4.SS3.p1">
<p class="ltx_p">To rigorously assess the competitiveness of our framework, we benchmark our RewardDance-optimized models against leading academic and industrial systems on three benchmarks: GenEval, Bench-240, and SeedVideoBench-1.0. As shown in Tables <a class="ltx_ref" href="https://arxiv.org/html/2509.08826v1#S4.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ 4.3 Comparison with State-of-the-art Generation Models ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ RewardDance: Reward Scaling in Visual Generation"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>, <a class="ltx_ref" href="https://arxiv.org/html/2509.08826v1#S4.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ 4.3 Comparison with State-of-the-art Generation Models ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ RewardDance: Reward Scaling in Visual Generation"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>, and <a class="ltx_ref" href="https://arxiv.org/html/2509.08826v1#S4.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ 4.3 Comparison with State-of-the-art Generation Models ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ RewardDance: Reward Scaling in Visual Generation"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>, models enhanced by RewardDance consistently achieve state-of-the-art performance.</p>
</div>
<div class="ltx_para ltx_noindent" id="S4.SS3.p2">
<p class="ltx_p"><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">GenEval.</span>
As shown in Table <a class="ltx_ref" href="https://arxiv.org/html/2509.08826v1#S4.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ 4.3 Comparison with State-of-the-art Generation Models ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ RewardDance: Reward Scaling in Visual Generation"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>, models enhanced with RewardDance demonstrate significant superiority across multiple dimensions of text-to-image generation. Seedream-3.0 w RewardDance achieves the top overall score of 0.79, while FLUX.1-dev w RewardDance follows closely at 0.75, outperforming strong baselines like SD3 (0.74). RewardDance confers overall performance gains of +0.10 and +0.09 on Seedream-3.0 w/o RewardDance and FLUX.1-dev, respectively. These advancements validate the efficacy of RewardDance in substantially enhancing semantic understanding and generative precision.</p>
</div>
<figure class="ltx_table" id="S4.T4">
<div class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:424.9pt;height:150.9pt;vertical-align:-150.9pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-177.6pt,0.0pt) scale(0.544698433363706,0.544698433363706) ;">
