</figure>
<div class="ltx_para ltx_noindent" id="S4.SS3.p4">
<p class="ltx_p"><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">SeedVideoBench-1.0.</span>
We also benchmark our method with Video-Text Alignment Score on video generation tasks (Table <a class="ltx_ref" href="https://arxiv.org/html/2509.08826v1#S4.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ 4.3 Comparison with State-of-the-art Generation Models ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ RewardDance: Reward Scaling in Visual Generation"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>), evaluating our RewardDance-aligned Seedance 1.0 against leading proprietary models.
The final score is the average rating calculated over all samples. In the Text-to-Video (T2V) evaluation, Seedance 1.0 achieves the highest average score of 1.66, outperforming strong competitors like Veo-3.0 (1.63) and Kling 2.1 (1.57). For the Image-to-Video (I2V) task, our model is also state-of-the-art, achieving a top-tier score of 1.65 and tying with the best-performing model, Kling 2.1. These findings underscore our framework’s ability to produce highly competitive, state-of-the-art video generations.</p>
</div>
